@* A band's heading (FX125): the page's one h1 in the band at its top, an h3 in a band that is a part of a section
   (F169.2), an h2 in any other. The class is the site's look, as the h2 a page used to write had; a part's title
   carries the framework's part-title before it. *@
@if (HeadsThePage)
{
    <h1 class="@Class">@ChildContent</h1>
}
else if (IsAPart)
{
    <h3 class="@PartClasses">@ChildContent</h3>
}
else
{
    <h2 class="@Class">@ChildContent</h2>
}
